    <string name="tips_folder_mutil_choice">You can realize the batch icon reposition or drag the icons from the folder by double-clicking on the icons.</string>
    <string name="tips_icon_option">When long-pressing on an icon you can change the icon angle with two fingers.Long-pressing and dragging an icon to the Desktop Switcher button/Delete button at the bottom of the screen to move it to another desktop/to delete it.</string>
    <string name="tips_lasso_option">When the lasso mode is activated, draw a path to lasso the icons for the next operations. When the path gets closed, there will be a pop-up menu and you can choose the correspondent option.</string>
