    <string name="tips_menu_sort">Long-pressing on the side bar handle and swiping up and down to change the order of the side bar handle.</string>
    <string name="tips_arrange_sort">In the Grid Arrangement Tool you can select more than one icon by double-clicking on them for the batch icon reposition.</string>
    <string name="tips_icon_change_desktop">Select an icon / widget, drag it to the desktop selector to enter the screen-selection interface, then drag the icon to an extended desktop and release it to realize icon / widget desktop-switch operation.</string>
